5. KEY ENHANCEMENTS OVER ORIGINAL PRD SPECIFICATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Dual Script Ingestion: Dashboard supports direct ChatGPT script pasting with
   a dedicated viral template copy button, alongside automated topic generation.
2. Zero-Cost Voice Synthesis: Added Microsoft Edge Neural TTS (Madhur voice)
   ensuring continuous generation without API credit exhaustion.
3. State Simulator Motion Graphics: Implemented EventLoopStateSimulator and
   RaceConditionSimulatorScene to visually animate code execution rather than
   using generic bullet points.
4. Integrated Sound Design: Procedural sound effects pack (whoosh, pop, ding,
   buzzer) and background ambient music ducking during voice narration.
5. High-Tempo Kinetic Captions: Word-by-word synced kinetic text popups with
   active neon glow for maximum viewer retention.
6. Automated Media QA: Enforces automated pre-review sanity gates (size, duration,
   SHA-256) stored directly in PostgreSQL.

